ven question by(...TRUNCATED)  |  [{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"browser.search\",\"description\":\"Searches for information rela(...TRUNCATED)  |  \n|  10  |  [{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"You are a deep research agent. You need to answer the given question by(...TRUNCATED)  |  [{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"browser.search\",\"description\":\"Searches for information rela(...TRUNCATED)  |  \n|  12  |  [{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"You are a deep research agent. You need to answer the given question by(...TRUNCATED)  |  [{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"browser.search\",\"description\":\"Searches for information rela(...TRUNCATED)  |  \nEnd of preview. \n* * *\n  *  Previous⟨29⟩\n  * 1⟨51⟩\n  * 2⟨52⟩\n  * 3⟨53⟩\n  * ...⟨54⟩\n  * 61⟨55⟩\n  * Next ⟨52⟩\n\n\n  * Processing⟨56⟩\n  * Configs⟨57⟩\n  * Usage⟨58⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨59⟩ OpenResearcher → Qwen3.5 SFT \n6003 deep-research agent trajectories for supervised fine-tuning of `Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B`, converted from OpenResearcher/OpenResearcher-Dataset⟨60⟩ (Harmony format) into OpenAI-style chat turns, stored as zstd-compressed Parquet.\nEach row is one example:\n  * `qid` — row id within its source seed split\n  * `messages` — `system`, `user`, then alternating `assistant` / `tool` turns:\n    * assistant reasoning is wrapped in `<think>...</think>` at the start of the turn\n    * tool calls are an OpenAI-style `tool_calls` list (`browser.search`, `browser.open`, `browser.find`)\n    * tool results are `role: \"tool\"` messages with a matching `tool_call_id`\n    * the final assistant turn contains the answer\n  * `tools` — the function-calling schema for the three browser tools, ready to pass to `tokenizer.apply_chat_template(messages, tools=...)`\n\n\nNote: Arrow unifies the schema across rows, so optional fields (`tool_calls`, `tool_call_id`, `name`, and unused keys inside `tools[*].function.parameters.properties`) appear as `None` where absent — filter out `None` values before passing to a chat template if yours doesn't ignore them.\n##   ⟨56⟩ Processing \nFrom the source dataset's `seed_*` splits: trajectories with corrupted Harmony artifacts (~14%) were dropped whole rather than repaired, trajectories over 131,072 Qwen3.5 tokens were dropped (not truncated, to avoid orphaning tool calls), and exact duplicate questions across seeds were removed (one trajectory per unique question). Mean length is ~47k tokens.\n##   ⟨57⟩ Configs \n  * `default` — 5,939 trajectories up to 131,072 Qwen3.5 tokens\n  * `64k` — the 5,359 of those trajectories that fit in 65,536 tokens, for training runs with a 64k sequence length (pre-filtered so no trajectory gets truncated mid-tool-call)\n  * `32k` — the 2,535 of those trajectories that fit in 32,768 tokens, for training runs with a 32k sequence length (pre-filtered so no trajectory gets truncated mid-tool-call)\n\n\n##   ⟨58⟩ Usage \n\n```\nfrom datasets import load_dataset\n\nds = load_dataset(\"DanielTobi0/openresearcher-qwen-sft\", split=\"train\")          # full, <=128k tokens\nds_64k = load_dataset(\"DanielTobi0/openresearcher-qwen-sft\", \"64k\", split=\"train\")  # <=64k tokens\nds_32k = load_dataset(\"DanielTobi0/openresearcher-qwen-sft\", \"32k\", split=\"train\")  # <=32k tokens\ntext = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(ds[0][\"messages\"], tools=ds[0][\"tools\"], tokenize=False)\n\n```\n\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    106\nNumber of rows: 13,897 Total file size: 439 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨61⟩ Privacy⟨62⟩ About⟨63⟩ Careers⟨64⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
